{
  "startNode": "node_01",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "node_01",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "text": "放學後的陽光透過窗戶灑在課桌上，空氣中彌漫著舊書與茶香。這是程式開發社團的午後。",
      "bg": "assets/bg/clubroom.jpg",
      "character": "",
      "bgm": "assets/audio/bgm_club.ogg",
      "cv": "",
      "next": "node_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_02",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "學姐",
      "text": "你終於來了！社團的 Galgame 引擎專案剛好遇到了瓶頸，我正需要你的幫忙。",
      "bg": "assets/bg/clubroom.jpg",
      "character": "assets/characters/senior.png",
      "bgm": "assets/audio/bgm_club.ogg",
      "cv": "assets/audio/cv_senior_01.ogg",
      "next": "choice_01"
    },
    {
      "id": "choice_01",
      "type": "choice",
      "choices": [
        { "text": "「包在我身上吧，學姐！我對 C++ 很有信心。」 (+10 好感度)", "next": "act_passionate" },
        { "text": "「感覺好麻煩啊... 可以先喝杯茶嗎？」 (好感度不變)", "next": "act_lazy" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "act_passionate",
      "type": "action",
      "flag": "favorability",
      "value": 10,
      "next": "node_03_a"
    },
    {
      "id": "act_lazy",
      "type": "action",
      "flag": "favorability",
      "value": 0,
      "next": "node_03_b"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_03_a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "學姐",
      "text": "我就知道你最靠得住！那我們現在就來看核心渲染器 (LayerRenderer) 的 Bug 吧。",
      "bg": "assets/bg/clubroom.jpg",
      "character": "assets/characters/senior_happy.png",
      "bgm": "assets/audio/bgm_club.ogg",
      "cv": "assets/audio/cv_senior_02.ogg",
      "next": "node_04"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_03_b",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "學姐",
      "text": "真是的，總是這麼提不起勁... 不過紅茶我剛好泡好了，先喝一杯再開始工作吧。",
      "bg": "assets/bg/clubroom.jpg",
      "character": "assets/characters/senior.png",
      "bgm": "assets/audio/bgm_club.ogg",
      "cv": "assets/audio/cv_senior_03.ogg",
      "next": "node_04"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_04",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "text": "幾小時過去了，夜幕逐漸降臨。螢幕上的代碼終於成功通過了編譯，視窗裡流暢地顯示出了打字機效果。",
      "bg": "assets/bg/clubroom.jpg",
      "character": "assets/characters/senior.png",
      "bgm": "assets/audio/bgm_club.ogg",
      "cv": "",
      "next": "node_05"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_05",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "學姐",
      "text": "太棒了！Gality 引擎居然真的跑起來了！為了慶祝專案里程碑，今晚要不要一起去吃個宵夜？",
      "bg": "assets/bg/clubroom.jpg",
      "character": "assets/characters/senior_happy.png",
      "bgm": "assets/audio/bgm_club.ogg",
      "cv": "assets/audio/cv_senior_04.ogg",
      "next": "choice_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "choice_02",
      "type": "choice",
      "choices": [
        { "text": "「好啊！我知道附近有一家超讚的拉麵店。」 (+10 好感度)", "next": "act_dinner" },
        { "text": "「太晚了，我想早點回去休息。」 (好感度不變)", "next": "act_go_home" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "act_dinner",
      "type": "action",
      "flag": "favorability",
